{"slug":"a-kh-dh","ar":"ء خ ذ","total":273,"core":"taking; seizing","forms":[{"ar":"أَخَذَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":127,"gloss":"To take, seize","word":"akhadha","ex":{"s":69,"a":30,"p":1,"ar":["خُذُوهُ","فَغُلُّوهُ"],"en":"[Allah will say], \"Seize him and shackle him"}},{"ar":"ٱتَّخَذَ","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":124,"gloss":"To take (for oneself), adopt","word":"ittakhadha","ex":{"s":19,"a":88,"p":2,"ar":["وَقَالُوا۟","ٱتَّخَذَ","ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","وَلَدًا"],"en":"And they say, \"The Most Merciful has taken [for Himself] a son"}},{"ar":"يُؤَاخِذُ","kind":"verb","form":3,"count":9,"gloss":"to take to task, punish","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":73,"p":3,"ar":["قَالَ","لَا","تُؤَاخِذْنِى","بِمَا","نَسِيتُ","وَلَا","تُرْهِقْنِى","مِنْ","أَمْرِى","عُسْرًا"],"en":"[Moses] said, \"Do not blame me for what I forgot and do not cover me in my matter with difficulty"}},{"ar":"أَخْذ","kind":"verbal noun","form":null,"count":6,"gloss":"seizure, taking","word":null,"ex":{"s":69,"a":10,"p":5,"ar":["فَعَصَوْا۟","رَسُولَ","رَبِّهِمْ","فَأَخَذَهُمْ","أَخْذَةً","رَّابِيَةً"],"en":"And they disobeyed the messenger of their Lord, so He seized them with a seizure exceeding [in severity]"}},{"ar":"آخِذ","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"taking, receiving","word":null,"ex":{"s":51,"a":16,"p":1,"ar":["ءَاخِذِينَ","مَآ","ءَاتَىٰهُمْ","رَبُّهُمْ ۚ","إِنَّهُمْ","كَانُوا۟","قَبْلَ","ذَٰلِكَ","مُحْسِنِينَ"],"en":"Accepting what their Lord has given them. Indeed, they were before that doers of good"}},{"ar":"مُتَّخِذ","kind":"active participle","form":8,"count":3,"gloss":"taker","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":51,"p":11,"ar":["مَّآ","أَشْهَدتُّهُمْ","خَلْقَ","ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَلَا","خَلْقَ","أَنفُسِهِمْ","وَمَا","كُنتُ","مُتَّخِذَ","ٱلْمُضِلِّينَ","عَضُدًا"],"en":"I did not make them witness to the creation of the heavens and the earth or to the creation of themselves, and I would not have taken the misguiders as assistants"}},{"ar":"ٱتِّخَاذ","kin